	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040g"},
		line=751,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnh... ghh...”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"My consciousness resurfaces with the sensation of a splitting headache.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Huh?)”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I open my eyes wide, but I still can't see anything.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"That's not all.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"My hands and feet refuse to move.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Huh? Huh?!)”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I struggle desperately.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"But my body doesn't budge.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"It seems like I've been bound in place to a chair.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(No way...)”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I immediately break out in a cold sweat.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"I can't contain the noise of my uncontrollably chattering teeth.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Have I been kidnapped?",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"By whom? For what reason?",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I struggle to even draw breath.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Even though I'm still on dry land, the anxiety and fear threatens to suffocate me.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hey, is anyone there?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"There is no answer.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The only thing I hear is the faint echoing of my own voice.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"It seems like I'm being held in a fairly large room.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"A sharp sound leaps into my ears.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Followed by another one.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"They're footsteps.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Slowly drawing closer to me.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"With each approaching step, my heart beats faster and faster.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The footsteps stop a short distance away.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Someone is right in front of me, within arm's reach.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"“Have you awakened, Your Highness?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"It takes me a while before I register the noise as a human voice.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It is the sound of a dread wind blowing across a desolate winter landscape. The sound of molten slag burrowing deep beneath the earth's depths.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"An entirely indescribable, yet absolutely intolerable, downright repulsive series of screeching sounds.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-Who's there?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I barely manage to croak out in a pitifully hoarse voice.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"My mouth is so dry that I feel like the membranes of my throat are going to tear apart.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you gonna do to me?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are your demands!?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where are we!?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I succumb to my mounting fear and scream out a flurry of questions.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"But I receive no answer.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Talk to me already, dammit!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Agh!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I fall over, taking the chair with me.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I feel the breath of a nasal chuckle on my face.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The humiliating pain stinging my shoulders races through the rest of my body.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"My body is suddenly lifted off the ground without warning.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I'm picked up and returned to my original sitting position.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah... haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"The tension and terror leave me short of breath.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"My whole body is drenched in sweat, and I can feel my clothes clinging tightly to my skin.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"“I wish to learn of...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"A hand reaches out and strokes my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I desperately grit my teeth in order to not reveal how much\nI'm trembling.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"“...the depths of your resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"The fingers gently trace a line down my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"They finally come to a rest right against the arteries in my neck.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"The sensation of my life being held in the palm of\nsomeone's hand threatens to suffocate me.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Soujin...!)”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nnh?!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I'm assailed by a piercing headache.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"But it vanishes without a trace in the very next instant.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"In front of me, Kotone and the manager have begun their ritual after having changed their clothes.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"They've brought a large, flat vase from downstairs and filled it with water, and they're now standing before it locked intently in prayer.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Apparently such a water basin is meant to stand in as a mirror.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee. Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She recites the invocation yet again.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"A tension so palpable as to be audible begins to fill the room.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Large beads of sweat begin to collect on Kotone's forehead, and the manager, offering his assistance beside her, also furrows his brow in pain.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The water mirror shimmers.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"The previously transparent water begins roiling, taking on a brilliant luster resembling that of quicksilver.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Eventually, the regular geometry of the ripples slowly distorts and takes on a definitive form.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(A map? Is this somewhere in the city?)”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ngh...!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ugh! Haah... haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Kotone pitches forward and falls onto her hands.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Her shoulders are shuddering violently.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh? This is most strange.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Once again, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Kotone begins praying in earnest without even wiping her sweat.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"It trickles down her face and stains the trim of her collar a deeper shade of vermilion.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall not... yield so easily...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I refuse to feel so powerless ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Hotori comes running over as soon as she's finished with her work at the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any leads?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not yet.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ko-Kotone...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Hotori is speechless when she sees the state Kotone is in.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"She has already attempted the ritual eight times.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Her hair is clinging to her drenched skin, and her overflowing sweat is splotched in countless stains on the floor.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"It's surely not my imagination that her cheeks look visibly more hollow.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The manager already ran out of stamina after the fourth prayer.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"He was merely assisting her, and yet even he collapsed from exhaustion.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Just how much of a burden must Kotone be bearing?",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The water mirror begins moving once again.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The quicksilver-like surface of the basin begins to take on an indistinct shape.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Please, let it work this time!)”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"The water mirror reflects a location I've seen before.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"It's a collection of warehouses near Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Though it's on the riverfront and bustling with workers unloading cargo during the day, it's completely deserted come nighttime.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, I think I know where that is.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? R-Really?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Kotone's vacant reaction shows she's completely out of it.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Call me right away if you figure out anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I grab the spellblade I had at the ready.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Um, Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"She calls out to me in a frail voice.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please take care out there.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I sense a sinister portent about this place.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Got it.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari... Please be safe...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I give voice to my innermost thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"My life, my pride...",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"My precious lord, Akari.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"We only just now swore an oath to restore the Empire together.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"And so, would it not be far too cruel if you were to die here?",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"When I look up beside me, I see Hotori staring at my face.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nothing...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you think Miyaguni will be there?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She will.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if she's not, we'll find her.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I refuse to let her die on me!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah... You're right...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Hotori turns away from me.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll definitely find her.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I hear the sharp sound of a blade being drawn.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"“I wish to test your resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I feel a cold sensation on the side of my face.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Even though I can't see, I can tell.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Its edge is being pressed against my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"“You wish to take down the chancellor, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(The chancellor?)”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Are they one of Okonogi's agents?",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"To think they'd come after me on the very same day I snuck into the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"“What's the matter? Aren't you going to take down Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"If I answer that I will, are they going to cut me up with that blade?",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Just imagining the pain makes me want to throw up.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"But...",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"I made a vow in front of Mother's grave that I wouldn't give up overthrowing Okonogi if my life depended on it.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I'll never yield in the face of violence!",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall strike Okonogi down with my own two hands.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I squeeze my eyes shut and brace myself for the intense pain.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
".........",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"But the blade pressed to my cheek does not move.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"“I want you to go back to Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"“Live out the rest of your days plowing the fields, and nobody will come after you.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi killed Empress Suou and sold out this country to the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“His station demands that he protect his people, but all he does is take from them while crushing anyone that dares to resist.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall see to it that I safeguard the Empire from Okonogi's grasp.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That is my sworn duty!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I loudly declare this, as though to convince myself.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If my only choice is to return to Iseya, I'd rather die here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're gonna kill me, then get on with it already!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"“Heh. What noble aspirations.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnh?!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I grit my teeth to prevent my voice from leaking out.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"I feel a burning pain on my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"A searing pain, like I've touched burning tongs.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"A moment later, I hear the sound of blood dripping down onto my chest and legs.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"“We've got plenty of time. No need to rush.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"The blade grazes my cheek once again.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"This isn't a threat anymore.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"They intend to keep hurting me until I scream out.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"“Just say that you'll go back to Iseya, and I'll let you go.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"“It really is that simple.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I won't give in!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"If I give in now, it'll be all over for me.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Even though it would be so easy to lie, I know that I'd never be able to forgive myself.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors put our very lives on the line to fight for our\nlord's sake.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if the enemy of our lord were a bosom friend or a cherished lover, we would not hesitate to cut them down.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, it is unpardonable that our lords should waver in their resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Know that so long as you proceed with an iron will, I shall bear no grudge no matter where, no matter when I am killed or forsaken!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I shall not waver.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I refuse to break my pledge, no matter how much I suffer.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Soujin... I swear I won't give in!)”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"...How many times have I been cut now?",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The stench of rust pierces my nostrils.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"For what feels like the millionth time, I'm asked the same question.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"And when I spit out the same answer, I'm assaulted by an excruciating pain.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Little by little, my consciousness begins to fade.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I won't... give in...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"A searing pain runs up my arm.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"I've already run out of places to be cut on my cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Heheh, look at you, trying to bend someone's will through pain. Aren't you ashamed of yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"“The sooner that you give in, the easier it will be for you...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He'll come and save me.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Soujin will come and save me, I know it.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I don't have any reason to think so, but I still know it.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"“Are you sure about that?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He will.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He absolutely will.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"“Well, I suppose he did try his best.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"My blindfold is removed.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"The first thing that I see is a tall ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"It seems like I'm in some sort of warehouse.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"It's a bare and dreary room, completely devoid of any─",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Gasp!*”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"My gaze is glued to one spot on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Soujin is lying face down there, his hands and feet tightly bound.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"His body is stained all over in crimson.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"“He did come to save you.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"“It's a shame he didn't succeed, though...”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"The person behind me moves next to Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"My face is covered in so much blood that I can barely make him out in my field of vision.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I can tell that the culprit is a man, but I can't make out his face.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"“Let's try another tack...”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"The man roughly hoists Soujin up by his hair.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Soujin's bloodstained face comes into view.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari... I've failed you as a warrior... I'm sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin! Stay with me!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"The man presses a dagger against Soujin's cheek.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"“I give you one of two choices.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"“Will you take him with you and go back to Iseya, or will you abandon him and continue your fight alone?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let Soujin go!”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ugh!”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I can't help but avert my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"It hurts so much more than being cut myself.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"“Now, what shall it be?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'll...”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"I involuntarily hesitate.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It is a warrior's greatest shame to be a shackle to his lord!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Go ahead and kill me now!”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"“Then let's see how much shame you can bear.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"The sound of bones splitting reverberates deep in my ears.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"The dagger pins Soujin's palm to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"And yet Soujin still maintains his expression, piercing the man with a ferocious glare.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"“Now then, let us hear your answer, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"“Will you give up on the chancellor, or will you cruelly leave this man to die?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"He pulls out another dagger.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'll...”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, remember the pledge you made at the grave!”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No lord should have to abandon their ambitions for the sake of a mere vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Soujin says all this to me with a kindly smile on his face.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Oh, Soujin...",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"I... I...",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
